From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:56:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] host,gfx,tools,ios: support DMMSLTR1 shader trailers in
 romfs.img

Allow DMROMFS1 images to carry a 16 KiB-aligned DMMSLTR1 shader trailer sub-image after the base RomFS index while keeping guest mounts, virtual readers and romfs.id identities bound strictly to base_romfs_size.

Add hidden dm_msl_trailer_* helpers with page-aligned mmap, multi-program DM_PROGRAM resolution and shell/gfx teardown hooks; wire NVN, Vulkan and OpenGL shader loading to fall back to the DM_ROMFS trailer when DM_MSL_DIR is absent; add --append-msl, --replace-msl and --inspect-msl to romfs_image.py; and record optional gfx_api and built_at fields in game.manifest.json.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Support page-aligned DMMSLTR1 shader trailers in romfs.img and record built_at and gfx_api in iOS manifests
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple
